[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10324.55, "timestamp": "02:52:04", "text": "So sad. Whenever I find people, I just"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10328.389, "timestamp": "02:52:08", "text": "go like, \"Hello, nice to see you, fellow"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10330.79, "timestamp": "02:52:10", "text": "Indian YouTuber. Good luck with your"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10332.389, "timestamp": "02:52:12", "text": "journey. Wishing you the best.\" Like"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10335.03, "timestamp": "02:52:15", "text": "that."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10339.11, "timestamp": "02:52:19", "text": "I just subscribe and join this server."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10340.95, "timestamp": "02:52:20", "text": "I don't really interact much. I'm kind"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10343.51, "timestamp": "02:52:23", "text": "of shy."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10346.309, "timestamp": "02:52:26", "text": "Same. I'm also a lucker when it comes to"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10348.15, "timestamp": "02:52:28", "text": "the squad server. I should just be there"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10349.99, "timestamp": "02:52:29", "text": "and look."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10353.19, "timestamp": "02:52:33", "text": "Maybe once upon a time look up things"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10355.51, "timestamp": "02:52:35", "text": "there or like talk or something or pop"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10361.67, "timestamp": "02:52:41", "text": "[Music]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10363.429, "timestamp": "02:52:43", "text": "That's what I did for the starscape"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10366.469, "timestamp": "02:52:46", "text": "thingy. You might have seen some"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10369.67, "timestamp": "02:52:49", "text": "sometimes in a while I pop up type in"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10371.51, "timestamp": "02:52:51", "text": "chat"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10379.99, "timestamp": "02:52:59", "text": "It's just random